    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Adapter: Ticket Store  (demo sink)\n\n**This writes to an n8n Data Table, not to a real helpdesk.** It is deliberately a one-node swap away from production.\n\n| Replace this node | With | Keep |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `Write ticket row` | Zendesk > Create Ticket | the trigger contract + the receipt |\n| `Write ticket row` | Freshdesk / Jira Service Management | same |\n\nThe caller only ever sees the receipt from `Return storage receipt`, so swapping the sink changes nothing upstream.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 660,
        "color": 3
      },
